{
  "id": "18578",
  "key": "SFCC-294",
  "summary": "Inventory – Back-in-Stock Email Notification Submission to Emarsys",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to register my email to be notified when an out-of-stock item returns to stock, so that I do not miss the opportunity to purchase it.\n\nWhen a Shopper submits their email on an Out of Stock PDP, the email and product details are sent to Emarsys via MuleSoft. The notification form is a PWA Kit component — no Contentful involvement.\n\nNOTE — Epic routing: Although this requirement (CAI-029) sits within the Cart and Inventory functional requirements, the user-facing component renders on the PDP. This story should be moved to the Product, Catalogue and PDP epic when that epic is next groomed. The Emarsys integration element may additionally warrant a story in an Integrations epic.",
